 {key:'exclusive',name:'Last Window at Meridian',kind:'exclusive',client:'Station Authority',skills:['Stealth','Computers','Piloting'],description:'A client has one opening to retrieve sensitive navigation data. Hard difficulty with an Exclusive deadline. Two phases must succeed at raised DCs. Accept only if you can deploy now and complete during this turn’s Events; one recovery turn follows.'}
